Draft line shape (from `handleAddWipRow`, lines 361-375): `{ tempId, workDate, skuCode, skuName, plannedQty, unit, shiftId, shiftCode, shiftName, sourceSectionDefId, sourceSectionName, workstreamCode, note }`.

